(Bug #110, buffer. The manual's own repro: `'toolbox's size` - a quoted
 name followed by a property - always worked, because the placeholder
 content then contains a space and was already routed through the full
 expression parser; only the bare `'toolbox'` alone, with no property and
 no space, hit the broken no-space guard.)

a buffer called 'toolbox' is 8 bytes in size.
append "AB" to 'toolbox'.
Print "{toolbox}".
Print "{'toolbox'}".
Print "{'toolbox's size}".
